'''MY FRIEND''' is the fifth and final ending theme for the Korean dub of ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]''. It debuted in [[XY094]], replacing [[Friends Forever]]. It uses the same animation from the corresponding Japanese ending theme, [[Puni-chan's Song]].

==Ending animation==
Bonnie plays and strolls in the grass along with [[Squishy]] while {{an|Clemont}}, {{Ash}}, and {{an|Serena}} watch.

==Characters==
* {{Ash}}
* {{an|Serena}}
* {{an|Clemont}}
* {{an|Bonnie}}

====Pokémon====
* {{p|Pikachu}} ({{OP|Ash|Pikachu}})
* {{p|Zygarde}} ([[List of Pokémon with form differences#Zygarde|Zygarde Core]]; [[Squishy]])

